# early fragment tests: a fragment shader that counts its fragments with image atomics under
# layout(early_fragment_tests), against a d16 depth pattern with LESS_OR_EQUAL (3); fragments the test
# rejects must not count (wgvk tests depth in the shader first: driver binding 938, read-only)
draw plain count 24 instances 2
topology triangles
vb 0 stride 8 rate vertex data floats
attr 0 binding 0 format R32G32_FLOAT offset 0
depth d16 3
